  - title: 03 / Observe sag and recovery
    explanation: The source still reads near 5 V. Nominal BUS is 4.12 V with one
      branch, 3.51 V with two, and 3.05 V with all three. At less than 3.25 V the
      controller records the sag and opens the fan contact. Pump plus demand then
      return to about 3.51 V.
    caption: "SOURCE STAYS NEAR 5 V \u2022 BUS VOLTAGE CHANGES"
    parts:
    - id: one
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.14, y: 0.8}
      label: PUMP 4.12 V
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - id: two
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.36, y: 0.6}
      label: ADD FAN 3.51 V
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - id: three
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.59, y: 0.33}
      label: SAG 3.05 V
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.34, b: 0.4, a: 1}
    - id: shed
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.84, y: 0.6}
      label: SHED 3.51 V
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    wires:
    - points:
      - {x: 0.14, y: 0.8}
      - {x: 0.36, y: 0.6}
      energized: 0
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - points:
      - {x: 0.36, y: 0.6}
      - {x: 0.59, y: 0.33}
      energized: 0
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.34, b: 0.4, a: 1}
    - points:
      - {x: 0.59, y: 0.33}
      - {x: 0.84, y: 0.6}
      energized: 0
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.71, b: 0.28, a: 1}
  - title: 04 / Restore deliberately
    explanation: 1/6 Pump alone. 2/6 CONNECT AUX and verify both loads. 3/6 APPLY
      DEMAND and record the sag. 4/6 Keep demand on while the pump voltage recovers
      and fan current drops near zero. 5/6 REMOVE DEMAND and verify the fan stays
      off. 6/6 RESTORE AUX and confirm both loads run again.
    caption: "DEMAND OFF + BUS \u2265 3.90 V \u2192 RESTORE AUX"
    parts:
    - id: shed
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.17, y: 0.59}
      label: AUX SHED
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.34, b: 0.4, a: 1}
    - id: remove
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.4, y: 0.59}
      label: DEMAND OFF
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.71, b: 0.28, a: 1}
    - id: recovered
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.63, y: 0.59}
      label: "BUS \u2265 3.90 V"
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - id: restore
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.85, y: 0.59}
      label: RESTORE AUX
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    wires:
    - points:
      - {x: 0.17, y: 0.59}
      - {x: 0.4, y: 0.59}
      energized: 0
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.71, b: 0.28, a: 1}
    - points:
      - {x: 0.4, y: 0.59}
      - {x: 0.85, y: 0.59}
      energized: 0
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
